  <body>
    <div class="container" id="execing-processes">
      <h2><a href="./index.html">Go в примери</a>: Изпълнение на процеси</h2>
      
        <div class="row">
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>В предишния пример разгледахме <a href="spawning-processes">създаването на външни
процеси</a>. Това го правим, когато искаме да имаме външен
процес, който да достъпваме от работещ Го процес. Понякога пък искаме
напълно да заместим текущия процес с друг, може би не написан на Го. За да
направим това, ще ползваме класическата функция <code>exec</code><sup class="footnote-ref" id="fnref:exec"><a href="#fn:exec">1</a></sup>, както е
осъществена в Го.</p>

<div class="footnotes">

<hr />

<ol>
<li id="fn:exec">exec – https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exec<em>(system</em>call)</li>
</ol>

</div>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code empty leading">
            
          
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            <a href="https://go.dev/play/p/bfRxTHMyFgz"><img title="Run code" src="play.png" class="run" /></a><img title="Copy code" src="clipboard.png" class="copy" />
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">package</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">main</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">(</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="s">&#34;os&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="s">&#34;os/exec&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="s">&#34;syscall&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">)</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kd">func</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">main</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>В нашия случай ще изпълним юникс командата <code>ls</code>. Го изисква абсолютен
пѫт до изпълнимия файл, затова ползваме <code>exec.LookPath</code> да го намерим
(може би <code>/bin/ls</code>).</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">binary</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">lookErr</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">:=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">exec</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">LookPath</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;ls&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="k">if</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">lookErr</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">!=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kc">nil</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="nb">panic</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nx">lookErr</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">}</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p><code>Exec</code> изисква податките да са във вид на отрязък (а не един голям низ).
Ще подадем на <code>ls</code> някои обичайни. Забележете че първият член на
отрязъка е името на програмата.</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">args</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">:=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">[]</span><span class="kt">string</span><span class="p">{</span><span class="s">&#34;ls&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&#34;-a&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&#34;-l&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&#34;-h&#34;</span><span class="p">}</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>На функцията <code>Exec</code> са ѝ нужни и <a href="environment-variables">променливи на
обкръжението</a>. Тук просто вземаме текущото
обкръжение.</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">env</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">:=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">os</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Environ</span><span class="p">()</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>А това е самото извикване на <code>syscall.Exec</code>. Ако извикването е успешно,
изпълнението на текущия процес ще приключи тук и ще бъде заместен  от
процеса <code>/bin/ls -a -l -h</code>. Ако новият процес върне грешка, взимаме я и
се ужасяваме.</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">execErr</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">:=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">syscall</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Exec</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nx">binary</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">args</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">env</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="k">if</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">execErr</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">!=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kc">nil</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="nb">panic</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nx">execErr</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
          </div><!-- end class="row" -->
      
        <div class="row">
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>Когато пуснем нашата програма, тя бива заместена от <code>ls</code>.</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="gp">$</span> go run execing-processes.go
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="go">общо 20K
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="go">drwxr-xr-x  2 berov berov 4,0K 18 юни 16:01 .
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="go">drwxr-xr-x 87 berov berov 4,0K 17 яну 14:27 ..
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="go">-rw-r--r--  1 berov berov 2,3K 18 юни 15:47 execing-processes.go
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="go">-rw-r--r--  1 berov berov   53 18 юни 16:03 execing-processes.hash
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="go">-rw-r--r--  1 berov berov  666 18 юни 16:01 execing-processes.sh</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>Забележете, че Го не предлага класическата в Юникс функция <code>fork</code>. Обикновено
това не създава пречки, понеже <em>гозадачите</em>, <em>пораждането</em> и <em>изпълнението</em>
на процеси покриват повечето от случаите, в които се ползва <code>fork</code>.</p>

          </div>
